  "name": "Algeria administrative divisions — 69 wilayas, 585 daïras, 1541 communes",
  "alternateName": [
    "Découpage administratif de l'Algérie",
    "التقسيم الإداري للجزائر",
    "algeria-wilayas-communes"
  ],
  "description": "Every Algerian administrative division below the national level, current as of the 2026 reform (Loi 26-06, Journal Officiel n°25): 69 wilayas, 585 daïra entries and 1541 communes. Each record carries Arabic, French and English names, and each commune a 5-digit postal code where one is published (1511 of 1541). Published as plain JSON, as an npm package, as a PyPI package, and as an MCP server. Note that most other sources still describe Algeria as having 58 wilayas, which was correct only until April 2026.",
  "url": "https://github.com/el-amin-dev/algeria-wilayas-communes",
  "sameAs": [
    "https://www.npmjs.com/package/algeria-wilayas-communes",
